{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：02:49 2026-11-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：02:49 2026-11-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：02:49 2026-11-23 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5d9b4f5cfc3961a6d716e960ef1a6ad/2026-11/taipo1.jpg\"/><p>大埔發生酒後駕駛案。周日（22日）晚上10時許，警方接獲途人報案，指大埔汀角路有私家車司機懷疑酒後駕駛。</p><p>警員接報到場，經初步調查，發現42歲姓梁男司機未能通過酒精呼氣測試，涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕。他其後獲准保釋候查，須於12月下旬向警方報到。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T19:04:14.360817+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T18:49:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T19:17:41.579804+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T18:57:44.387040+00:00","content_hash":"8b7b7c821fad9b8521dd474b7f9726650fcc74b4efd27210043505bb04a7acf7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}